ione, per aiutarli a catturare una pericolosa banda di ladri professionisti.","tagline":"Sta addestrando una nuova generazione di forze dell'ordine per una missione pericolosa per salvare il mondo da criminali spietati."},{"language":"en-US","title":"The Shadow's Edge","overview":"Macau Police brings the tracking expert police officer out of retirement to help catch a dangerous group of professional thieves.","tagline":"He's training a new generation of law enforcers for a dangerous mission to save the world from ruthless criminals."},{"language":"zh-CN","overview":"一伙天才盗匪劫走数亿资产，却凭借超强反侦察能力全身而退，戏耍警方“天眼”系统。一筹莫展之际，澳门司警局请回了隐退多年的跟踪专家黄德忠，他培养年轻司警何秋果等人，重组“神秘跟踪队”，最终锁定了盗匪团的幕后狼王傅隆生。当警方布下天罗地网之时，盗匪团也设下局中局，斗智斗勇斗心眼，一场高端猫鼠局拉开帷幕……","tagline":"他正在为一项危险任务训练新一代执法者，以从冷酷无情的罪犯手中拯救世界。"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/aTq2VZLuQzwfCPiBlWeJG8z6XKD.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4BtL2vvEufDXDP4u6xQjjQ1Y2aT.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":1419406,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"zh-CN","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/aTq2VZLuQzwfCPiBlWeJG8z6XKD.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/aTq2VZLuQzwfCPiBlWeJG8z6XKD.jpg","language":"it","width":2000,"height":3000},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/aTq2VZLuQzwfCPiBlWeJG8z6XKD.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/aTq2VZLuQzwfCPiBlWeJG8z6XKD.jpg","language":"it","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5op5LVKyjxjwx97778nmSSYQpQz.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5op5LVKyjxjwx97778nmSSYQpQz.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5vNcvJ4suJYHCMKfUZBIbm1yu2N.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5vNcvJ4suJYH